# CR 601.2c: casting an Aura chooses its target before paying the cost --
# castAura (castspell.go), CastSpell's own Aura branch. Grizzly Bears is the
# only creature on the battlefield, so it is assigned automatically with no
# `queue enchanttarget` needed (the same "nothing meaningful to decide"
# reasoning a lone attack target already gets). Two Plains pay Pacifism's
# {1}{W}: the white pip auto-pays from the pool, the generic unit through
# queue paygeneric. resolvestack moves Pacifism to the battlefield and
# attaches it through attachEffect -- APIAttach's own Registry entry.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
